t;\"><strong>📩&nbsp;想看房嗎？</strong>請加入我們&nbsp;Line&nbsp;官方帳號</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"><strong>Line&nbsp;ID：@totozu（會優先回覆看房時間）</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;󠀠</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-color: transparent;\">🚴腳踏車</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-color: transparent;\">1分鐘到&nbsp;7-11便利商店</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-color: transparent;\">1分鐘到&nbsp;CITYLINK&nbsp;內湖店</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-color: transparent;\">2分鐘到&nbsp;內湖捷運站</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-color: transparent;\">2分鐘到&nbsp;全聯福利中心</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-color: transparent;\">4分鐘到&nbsp;湖光市場</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;󠀠</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-color: transparent;\">📌&nbsp;租金:&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;獨立衣帽間、洗衣機&nbsp;大套房<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;1人入住&nbsp;NT$17,800 (租補後NT$14,200)</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;2人入住&nbsp;NT$19,800 (租補後NT$12,600)<br><br>📌&nbsp;地點:&nbsp;114台北市內湖區金龍路10x號3樓&nbsp;公寓&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-color: transparent;\">📌&nbsp;格局:&nbsp;1套3雅1廳2衛浴</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); background-color: transparent;\">📌&nbsp;能源費:&nbsp